# Colcon build artefacts.
#
# These used to be committed (3,995 files, 221 MB, deepest path 271 chars), which is what
# forced every Windows user to set `git config core.longpaths true` before cloning. They were
# also deleted on every container create by the old setup.sh, so they never once served as a
# cache. The dev container now keeps build/install/log in per-user Docker named volumes
# (see src/.devcontainer/devcontainer.json), seeded from the prebuilt image.
cache/

# A colcon build run directly on the host rather than in the container.
/build/
/install/
/log/
